9. confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
10. activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
11. load_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha
12. unload_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha

Now after step12, route_task_profile_available false (since attached to origin and not detached). That's fine as goal requires it linked to origin.

Now assemble transport leg:

13. assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha

Now execute schedule dispatch:

14. execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma dispatch_slot_alpha

